# Line endings are part of the build here, not a preference.
#
# This project is developed on Windows and deployed from Linux. A carriage
# return inside a GitHub Actions `run:` block is a shell syntax error
# (`$'\r'`), and a CRLF Dockerfile can break `\` continuations. Forcing LF in
# the working tree means what the developer sees is what the runner executes.
#
# Binary assets keep their bytes untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.onnx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.db binary
